# p_8f2d — Omar's tablet is a dresser device on weekend afternoons

On weekends Omar is off work. He wakes around 9:00–10:00, showers, gets dressed at the dresser, and plugs his tablet in on the dresser top to charge or browse while he gets ready. By midday (12:00–18:00) the tablet is sitting on the dresser, not the nightstand. This explains the day-5 Sunday 12:00 sighting of tablet_omar at dresser_b1, which no existing document predicted. p_e91b's claim that the tablet is at the nightstand on weekend afternoons has gone against 8 times with zero support. On weekdays the tablet returns to the nightstand (Omar is at work 14:00–23:00, tablet undisturbed at the bedside). What sets this apart: weekend afternoon tablet location is dresser_b1, not nightstand_b1. What would refute it: tablet_omar sighted at nightstand_b1 on a Saturday or Sunday between 12:00 and 18:00.

